id: weak-hold
name: Weak Hold
restriction: true
reduction: 5
locked: Energy Web, Binding Volleyball
# "Rather than inflict the Pinned Combat Condition, inflict the Guard Down Combat Condition."
bindCondition: guard-down
source: Core Rule
text: >
  Weak Hold: Even while you bind your enemies, they are still able to fight.
  –Locked Advancements: Energy Web, Binding Volleyball
  –TP Cost: -5
  –Effect: Rather than inflict the Pinned Combat Condition, inflict the Guard Down Combat Condition through the effects
  of the Binding Unique Ability. Replace all mentions of ‘Pinned’ with ‘Guard Down’ in the effects of the Binding Unique
  Ability.
